8秒，16:9 横版，写实风格。女子A（@图片1）与女子B（@图片2）在湖边亭子（@图片3）内聊天打趣。明亮日间光线，多机位切镜，硬切。\n\n【画面过程描述】\n\nShot 1（0-4s）— 女子A调侃\n- 景别：中景，过肩镜头\n- 场景：湖边亭子内（@图片3），白天自然光\n- 主体：女子A（@图片1）与女子B（@图片2）\n- 运镜：固定机位\n- 动作：女子A伸手指向女子B，表情调侃\n- 台词：女子A说：\"姐妹，你最近好像又胖了啊！\"\n- 音效：微风声、鸟鸣\n- 转场：硬切\n\nShot 2（4-7s）— 女子B反驳\n- 景别：近景\n- 场景：湖边亭子内（@图片3）\n- 主体：女子B（@图片2）\n- 运镜：轻微推镜头\n- 动作：女子B挺胸抬头，自信反驳\n- 台词：女子B说：\"这哪叫胖，这叫丰满！\"\n- 音效：无\n- 转场：硬切\n\nShot 3（7-8s）— 两人大笑\n- 景别：全景\n- 场景：湖边亭子内（@图片3）\n- 主体：女子A（@图片1）与女子B（@图片2）\n- 运镜：固定机位\n- 动作：两人互相看着对方，前仰后合开心大笑\n- 台词：无\n- 音效：两人爽朗的笑声\n- 转场：结束\n\n【不想要】\n- 现代城市建筑背景\n- 画面外其他人物\n- 非叙事性音乐：N/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [338.1865234375, 729.7241821289062], "pos": [-2244.566162109375, 5277.3359375], "id": 138, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [261], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [8], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "Float (Duration)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [324.4568176269531, 73.53536987304688], "pos": [-2246.49755859375, 5138.05029296875], "id": 132, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 16}, {"showAdvanced": false, "outputs": [{"name": "width", "links": [276], "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [277], "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["16:9 (Widescreen)", 1, 32], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "aspect_ratio"}, "name": "aspect_ratio", "label": "aspect_ratio", "type": "CO